arxiv-2508-08089.description:
A 2025 arXiv research paper by F. A. Chiarello, G. Girardi, S. Lucente. We investigate semilinear wave-type equations that can be recast as wave equations with derivatives perturbed by zero-order terms. This framework covers several well-studied cases, including the scale-invariant wave equation. In this setting, we refine existing blow-up results for radial initial data with suitable decay, and identify conditions on the zero-order terms that govern the interplay between derivative perturbations, initial data size, and nonlinearity exponent. 2010 Mathematics Subject Classification
Primary 35B33;
Secondary 35L70.
